# headwear/cloth/circlet: the Circlet (OUTER, P2b wave 2): a thin band of the person's trim metal (brass by default) round the brow,
# over the hair, a gem in the accent colour at the front; it hides no hair (the hair keeps its full style).
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role headwear circlet
layer headwear
anchor head
keys hatpose
legend m accent 0
legend p accent 3

view D key rest origin 0 -4
|.......mm.......
|.POOOOOmpOONNNN.
|.......mm.......

view U key rest origin 0 -6
|POOOOOOONNNNNNNN

view R key rest origin 0 -5
|POOOONNNNNNNNpm

view L key rest origin -1 -5
|mpOOOOONNNNNNNN

view L key lie origin -1 -5
|mpOOOOONNNNNNNN
